## Architecture
- API routes: src/api/ (Express, REST)
- Database: PostgreSQL via Prisma ORM, schema in prisma/schema.prisma
- Auth: Clerk, middleware in src/middleware/auth.js
- Frontend: Next.js, pages in src/app/
- Background jobs: Bull queue, workers in src/workers/
- Config: .env for secrets, src/config/ for app config

## Conventions
- All API responses use {success: boolean, data: any, error: string} shape
- Database queries go through service layer (src/services/), never called directly from routes
- Errors use custom AppError class (src/utils/errors.js)
- All new code must have corresponding test file in tests/ with same path structure

## Do Not Modify
- src/legacy/: old payment system, being deprecated, do not refactor
- migrations/: never generate or run migrations without explicit approval
- .env: never read or modify environment files
